cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Undeciphered.ca: Canadian Historical Ciphers Archive (1673-1945)"
message: "If you cite or build upon decodings, transcriptions, or archival notes from Undeciphered.ca, please cite this project as below and verify every reading against its linked holding archive."
type: dataset
authors:
