abstract: "An independent, non-commercial archive indexing 859 raw historical Canadian coded letters, telegrams, and wartime intercepts (1673-1945), including 854 solved dispatches and 219 first modern readings, alongside an opt-in reference catalog of 2,035 published historical cipher summaries."
